I turn on the gas stove.
I place a pan on it.
I tell myself the instructions from the video.
"First, heat two spoons of oil in the pan."
I put two spoons of oil in the pan.
The oil heats up quickly.
"Then, fry the peanuts in the oil."
I put some peanuts in the hot oil.
I fry them well.
The color of the peanuts changes a little.
I take the fried peanuts out onto a small plate.
I put half a spoon of mustard seeds in the oil.
The mustard seeds crackle nicely.
Then, I add the finely chopped onions to it.
I also add the chopped green chilies to it.
The onions slowly turn golden.
I mix everything together with a spoon.
A very nice aroma fills the kitchen.
